# The exact denial each document in flux-reconciler-rbac-bypasses.yaml must produce.
# scripts/test-policy-fixtures.sh compares this whole set: a message that
# disappears is a weakened rule, a message that appears is an unreviewed
# denial. File-level rejection alone hides both.
ClusterRole crd-controller-flux-system is bound to all three controllers and must not grant helm.toolkit.fluxcd.io
ClusterRole crd-controller-flux-system is bound to all three controllers and must not grant source.toolkit.fluxcd.io
ClusterRole crd-controller-flux-system must not grant a wildcard resources
ClusterRole crd-controller-flux-system must not grant a wildcard verbs
ClusterRole flux-cluster-impersonator must not grant impersonate at cluster scope
ClusterRole flux-token-minter must not grant ServiceAccount token creation
ClusterRole crd-controller-helm-flux-system must not grant cluster-wide Secret access
ClusterRole crd-controller-helm-flux-system must not grant cluster-wide Secret access
ClusterRole crd-controller-helm-flux-system must grant exact HelmChart lifecycle and read-only OCIRepository secondary watch authority
ClusterRole crd-controller-helm-flux-system must grant exact HelmChart lifecycle and read-only OCIRepository secondary watch authority
ClusterRole crd-controller-helm-flux-system must grant exact HelmChart lifecycle and read-only OCIRepository secondary watch authority
ClusterRole crd-controller-helm-flux-system must not write Secrets
ClusterRole crd-controller-kustomize-flux-system must grant only exact read-only Bucket, GitRepository, and OCIRepository secondary watches
ClusterRole crd-controller-kustomize-flux-system must grant only exact read-only Bucket, GitRepository, and OCIRepository secondary watches
ClusterRole crd-controller-kustomize-flux-system must grant only exact read-only Bucket, GitRepository, and OCIRepository secondary watches
ClusterRole crd-controller-source-flux-system must not grant cluster-wide Secret access
ClusterRole flux-pvc-manager must not grant cluster-wide PVC authority
ClusterRoleBinding crd-controller-helm-flux-system must bind only flux-system/helm-controller
ClusterRoleBinding crd-controller-source-flux-system must bind ClusterRole crd-controller-source-flux-system
ClusterRoleBinding cluster-reconciler-flux-system must not bind cluster-admin
ClusterRoleBinding flux-operator-view must not bind a wildcard aggregation role
Role flux-controller-impersonation must restrict impersonate to named accounts
Role flux-system/flux-controller-decryption must not grant Secret access
Role flux-system/flux-controller-runtime must not grant a wildcard verbs
Role lidersea-com/helm-reconciler must grant PVC lifecycle only as the exact naranjo-online helm-reconciler rule
Role naranjo-online/helm-reconciler must not grant direct pods workload control outside the exact Helm readiness read-back
Role naranjo-online/readiness-lookalike must not grant direct replicasets workload control outside the exact Helm readiness read-back
RoleBinding quiet-escalation must not bind cluster-admin
crd-controller-flux-system must bind exactly the three installed controllers
kustomize-controller must disable ConfigMap and Secret event watchers with the exact reviewed feature gate
the cluster-admin reconciler binding must be deleted, not rendered
